    message: "Hi Jaanu... happiest 21st year, my love. I'm sorry I couldn't be by your side again, but I promise to give my best and make your day just a little better.\nFirst of all, good morning jaanu😙🩷✨️!! How are you? Are you doing well? Are you eating properly? Are you taking good care of yourself? How are your studies going? Are you healthy? I probably called you, and by now we are probably talking. I miss you jaanu... I miss you so much every single day... I've thought about us multiple times ever since I laid my eyes on you. I've thought about us being good friends, and I succeeded in that. I've thought about us being best friends, and I once again succeeded. I've thought of us being more than just friends... and look where we ended up... up until now... I made a mistake thinking I succeeded... but in reality... it was never just an 'I' but... we. WE succeeded, jaanu. WE together succeeded. \nPlease don't have any expectations. I haven't done any planning this time due to my busy and hectic schedule.\nYou will never know how many times I looked at your photo at night with eyes full of tears, just because I missed you every time. I have prayed multiple times asking 'please god, protect this girl when I'm not around her.. I want to see her happy and healthy everyday'.\nIf I were right there, I would've kissed you hundreds of times, would've fought with you on every single argument, would've stayed silent as you lashed out, would've listened to all your rants and baby voice. I would've cuddled you until we let our emotions out, would give my entire self for you, sleep in the same space where you are, rant about my day and problems, send you hundreds of couple memes even though you are beside me... I regret ever being mad at you, and times like these are what make me realize how bad of a person I was to you... how I should've treated you better, communicated better with you, walked along the sidewalk in complete silence, held your hand when it was necessary, and made more time when you needed me... \nIf you had noticed.. I always tried to hold your hand, only to reassure you that I am not going anywhere.. and that's the reason even when we have some argument, I still wait to hold onto your hand, give you space, make you laugh, just so I can hold your hand one last time.. I don't want to miss that feeling ever again.. so I try to do it whenever it is possible.. I hope you know i regret every time i made you sad or hurt you. I am sorry.\nI would want to change all the things I made mistakes on, but without those mistakes, we wouldn't be here loving each other to the deepest, knowing each other to the fullest, caring for each other with our best efforts, and being with each other until the last moment.\nWe have been through a lot of emotions. Every emotion is a lesson for us, and I strive to be better than I was yesterday every time.\nI promise to take good care of you regardless of the occasion, date, time, or situation. I promised myself and you that I would keep you happy, make us better together, make us stronger than the day before, make you succeed, secure, and independent. I promise to make sure you achieve everything you want, and I will make sure to keep my promise.\nFor a man, this is one of the worst feelings I can ever experience.. It's when I have that one perfect women.. you.. who is with me when I have nothing.. but you still chooses me.. you still believe in me.. that's one of the worst feeling.. I know I wanna do many things for you, I want to do so so many things.. I want to buy you so many things.. I am not able to do them just because I am still building.. and I know eventually I am going to earn.. eventually I am going to provide for you.. but right now.. its really hard.. I'm typing this it out.. cause I'm too scared to tell it to your face and that I am genuinely grateful for you.. I cannot imagine a journey without you.. I am going to provide everything that you deserve..\nYou know, one day I wished you'd find someone really good for you and have a shoulder to cry on... I remember you stating, 'my life is already colorless.' I hoped you have the prettiest shade of colors in your life, and I will be forever grateful to the one supporting you now and in the future.\nSuch a strange turn of events... I got to be the one I wished for you. How lucky am I? What are the odds? That out of 4 billion people on Earth, I get to be your loved one.\nRemember? One day you sent me a post which says 'love him so insanely that either he'll be my endgame or End my game'.. I am your endgame and you are my endgame.. this is the endgame.\nI hope you know, clothes on or off, hair done or not, smiling or crying, happy or sad.\nYou are always my beautiful girl.\nHappy Teacher Day to you Jaanu, cause somehow you are the answer to all my questions. You taught me how to be calm, how to control emotions, how to behave, how to react at any situation, when to respond to events, how to prioritize myself, care about me, and with all such more things you taught me, I think you at least deserve a little thank you. So, thank you for guiding me. \nPlease be clingy with me, always text me, annoy me, send me selfies, and tell me about your day. I'd love that. One day when I take you to Canada.. its just gonna be us.. you & me, airport coffee, couple suitcases, side by side seats, a new country.\nOne day you asked me who is the braver one out of the two in the relationship... is it the one who left the country or the one who stayed behind... and if you ask me, I would say it is you and it has always been you. I had to leave the country because I had no choice. I will meet new people, explore new places, make new memories, which might be good or bad... but... when it comes to you, you would be roaming with people whom you already know... who already know about us... you would be visiting places where we have already been. Everything just echoes our memories, just makes everything difficult to not miss me more, whether you like it or not... and you have to live through it every day... you will be waiting and adjusting to the same routine... just... without me... now tell me... who is the braver one?\nAll of these might seem like a rant to you for now.. but I hope one day you would realise that this is not a rant.. but an appreciation message from me to you.. how much I want to have you in every step, how much everything matters to me regarding you, how much I love you.. \nAnd finally... once again, happiest 21 years, jaanu... you mean a lot to me... if there is one thing to convey, then that would be... ninnu vadhili ekkadiki vellanu... nenu ikkade vunta... do everything you love... I will always and forever be there to support you, jaanu... thank you for everything. I love you so much...\nyours, cutu.\n\n",
